{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining the scvi_n200 RNA encoder with the stronger imagenet_vit_l image encoder, using transformer aggregation and feature concatenation. Validation accuracy (0.721) and F1 (0.681) exceeded the best RNA-only baseline (0.653), suggesting multimodal integration may improve performance. However, the relative contributions of the image encoder, aggregation method, and fusion strategy remain uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative configurations."
}

